# i18n (Transloco)

- Use **`@jsverse/transloco`** via `@silvervibe/shared/i18n`. Default locale **`en`**; also maintain **`nl`**, **`de`**, **`fr`**, **`el`**, **`es`**.
- Do not leave new user-visible English (or any language) hard-coded in templates/TS — extract keys under nested scopes (`common`, `auth`, `shell`, `landing`, `standup`, …).
- When adding or renaming a key, update **every** locale JSON in `libs/shared/i18n/assets/i18n/` in the same PR.
- Do not translate brand names (SilverVibe, VibeStandup).
- Prefer Transloco in shared `feature-auth` / `ui` so both apps stay in sync.
- After UI copy changes, run/format locale JSON with Prettier; keep LF endings.
